# Scenario dead-after-refusal (review WR-02, D-20, D-22): outcome harness-fail, exit 14. The
# expected cartridge refusal ends the scenario, so the run-to and the assert after it could never
# run: the parser refuses the file at the run-to, ivs-run prints no report and one line on stderr.
# expect-stderr: scenario-syntax line=13 reason=dead-after-refusal
ivss 1
id dead-after-refusal
profile intv-2609-ntsc-family-p1
content exec boot-stub
content grom zero-grom
content cart diag-cpu-1-truncated.ivsc
expect-load cart IVS_E_MALFORMED

run-to 4000 cpu-cycles stop halted
assert halted == yes
